{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00180",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.31,
      "end_seconds": 5.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, I couldn't find the door at first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.73,
      "end_seconds": 11.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.46,
      "end_seconds": 16.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "I'm here because of puffiness around the eyes in the morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.45,
      "end_seconds": 19.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.89,
      "end_seconds": 23.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "For about three months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.71,
      "end_seconds": 27.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "What about itching, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.64,
      "end_seconds": 33.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Yeah, that too. As for itching, it happens on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.56,
      "end_seconds": 35.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "What about tiredness, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.67,
      "end_seconds": 39.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.68,
      "end_seconds": 44.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Alright, have you had any chest pain, fever or reduced urine output?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.83,
      "end_seconds": 49.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "I haven't had chest pain, fever or reduced urine output, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.07,
      "end_seconds": 53.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.64,
      "end_seconds": 55.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.81,
      "end_seconds": 60.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.74,
      "end_seconds": 72.77,
      "duration_seconds": 9.03,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.42,
      "end_seconds": 77.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.37,
      "end_seconds": 81.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Penicillin. I come out in... well, hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.55,
      "end_seconds": 84.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.92,
      "end_seconds": 88.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I had a lump removed from my back years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.34,
      "end_seconds": 94.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.61,
      "end_seconds": 97.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "My uncle had colon cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.68,
      "end_seconds": 102.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.58,
      "end_seconds": 104.28,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.77,
      "end_seconds": 124.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.69,
      "end_seconds": 131.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "I, I have kidney disease. I have diabetes, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.37,
      "end_seconds": 140.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known diabetes. We'll keep that in mind today. Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.63,
      "end_seconds": 144.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.1,
      "end_seconds": 148.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.85,
      "end_seconds": 157.74,
      "duration_seconds": 7.89,
      "text": "I take metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar. I'm on diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when I get pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.23,
      "end_seconds": 161.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.18,
      "end_seconds": 175.35,
      "duration_seconds": 11.17,
      "text": "Uh, not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.43,
      "end_seconds": 179.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.01,
      "end_seconds": 188.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Alright, just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.61,
      "end_seconds": 215.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 97 percent, heart rate 82. And temp 36.9 degrees, pressure 145 over 100."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.0,
      "end_seconds": 220.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.02,
      "end_seconds": 223.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Let me check your reflexes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.57,
      "end_seconds": 244.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "There's pitting swelling at both ankles, and your blood pressure is on the high side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.64,
      "end_seconds": 256.98,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.6,
      "end_seconds": 259.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.61,
      "end_seconds": 261.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.57,
      "end_seconds": 297.65,
      "duration_seconds": 23.08,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with progression of the kidney problem at this stage. I can't rule out a medication effect on the kidneys yet. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had puffiness around the eyes in the morning for about three months, and no reduced urine output or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.53,
      "end_seconds": 300.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.95,
      "end_seconds": 315.14,
      "duration_seconds": 13.19,
      "text": "We should do kidney function tests for chronic kidney disease. Let's get an ultrasound of the kidneys, for chronic kidney disease. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.43,
      "end_seconds": 318.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Okay, uh, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.77,
      "end_seconds": 343.29,
      "duration_seconds": 23.52,
      "text": "Stay off anti-inflammatory painkillers like diclofenac or ibuprofen, they're hard on the kidneys. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.79,
      "end_seconds": 346.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Yes, um, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.39,
      "end_seconds": 350.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.91,
      "end_seconds": 356.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.78,
      "end_seconds": 364.52,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.96,
      "end_seconds": 370.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.06,
      "end_seconds": 377.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 381.15,
      "end_seconds": 383.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}